cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
title: "Shifting, Not Lifting: Minimum Wages and Low-Skilled Workers in Peru (replication package)"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a difference-in-differences study of the May 2022
  Peruvian minimum-wage reform (Remuneracion Minima Vital, from 930 to 1,025
  soles), contrasting low- and high-education workers using the quarterly ENAHO
  employment surveys, 2021-2024, with an out-of-sample validation on the January
  2025 reform. Includes the data pipeline, estimation and robustness code, the
  literature database, publication figures and tables, and the LaTeX manuscript.
type: software
authors:
